NOTE: Deleting WORK.TESTS (memtype=DATA).
NOTE: Deleting WORK.VARIANCE (memtype=DATA).
29117    !                                         quit;


29118      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
29119      
29120      data sample;
29121       input x y group $ freq weight;
29122       datalines;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SAMPLE has 12 observations and 5 variables.

29135      ;
